# Resolution Log: PrismPM Rust-First FFI Architecture
Task ID: prismpm-cpp-backend
Date: 2026-10-15
Author: Yassine

## Resolution Details
- prismpm-cpp-backend formally migrated to prismpm-rust-bridge.
- Rather than forcing a custom C++ AST codegen backend into prismpm/prod-codegen (which natively emits verified Rust crates), we accept Rust as the authoritative extraction target.
- Verification and contract enforcement in C++ (lgcc) will interface with prismpm's generated Rust code via standard C ABI FFI (`extern "C"` bindings already supported by prod-codegen/c_abi.rs).
- All dependent DAG tasks updated accordingly.
